# Handoffs

When the user asks for a handoff, write it in this repo at `handoffs/YYYY-MM-DD-session-handoff.md`. If that file already exists, add a short suffix: `handoffs/YYYY-MM-DD-session-handoff-2.md`.

Do not save handoffs only in the OS temp directory. The copy in `handoffs/` is the one to keep.

Still follow the handoff skill for the document itself: summarize the session, name suggested skills, point at existing artifacts by path, and leave out secrets and personal contact details.
